    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e38b8b8b73b56c127dd1f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──真是艰难的课题。\n是该为了跟劲敌决战而走上后冠路线呢？\n还是为了出赛德比而挑战经典三冠？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce708f42dd798e833fda786d9ab6410380cdf2c897564e29a30fae221818e8c2",
