      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63a1eb20769b047843532513",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想跟这样的她来场GⅠ正式比赛──\n这个念头一直挥之不去。\n所以──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2178e52108aafeb96b911e903ba8146cc20ef1e8002959002df76335d19b8c92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b378425031ba80d3b61b917d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你要放弃获得三冠与三后冠？",
