      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先出赛“樱花赏”然后前进“日本德比”，\n这样如何？我想只有这个办法了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6b0131a5498c2080a0ad392c7750efec8563563328fc6189699786156cc075",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008306.json",
      "json_path": [
