      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果想追逐所有无法割舍的目标，\n我就只想得到这个办法了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbafb0e4e33e6baac6f51168cee7fafd56247e24e1f656ee988d2703096ca36f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e17c6a21f23d7ad3231193ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来就参加“樱花赏”吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ceea59d86a89fc02fec775a64a0ed8194617549f68f2347547b4268da09b19b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
